{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>erotic dating sim</strong>  set in a\u00a0country ruled by beastmen, where magic power and upbringing determines your fate. You play as a mere human - your goal is to assist <strong>your half-beast childhood friend, Mirika</strong>, in proving her worth as successful magician &amp; blacksmith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197210/extras/d49e564eb7ccad67df4e6da7d78ccc27.avif?t=1761660579\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your boss fall in love with you!</strong> Raise her affection level, aid her in studying intricacies of arcane theory, and help her become the best magic blacksmith in the capital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take on the role of workshop manager! \u00a0<strong><i>Acquire materials in dungeons,</i></strong>\u00a0remove impurities from ore to <i><strong>smelt high-quality ingots</strong>,</i> and <i><strong>learn new recipes</strong></i> to craft weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197210/extras/6d525235c19b8cf4ee7df0b11619fbfd.avif?t=1761660579\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Engaging Visual Storytelling:</u></strong>\u00a0A hand-dawn, vivid fantasy, full of adventures &amp; romance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Date System</strong>:</u>\u00a0Go on dates with Mirika to earn her trust and affection and unlock special moments together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dressing Room:</u></strong>\u00a0Choose clothes that Mirika can wear in sex scenes and romantic moments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <st